      "source_text": "影响着迷人景致的是――“极度的兴奋”。\n来自观众与赛马娘们……来自所有人的兴奋。\n",
      "source_fingerprint": "e146fbcecbd4b659f04818d9166e8379ec549741b96ae496316c0b7133d1f2e3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1114/storytimeline_501114103.json",
      "json_path": [
