    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b9d752d76da0b430f34e007",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迷人景致",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d00a4803d17b32d08d3d9ae9844b52810f0b4162c25dd8d8a1226ea163081d6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1114/storytimeline_501114103.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        47,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/47/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ca532e0d28aa090b3038270",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "所以呢、训练员。\n这次在『秋华赏』我想采取更强势的战术！\n到更靠前的位置、要不试试跑逃――",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e31d69f30459f2dadb1e4e73c99719650267cf680f11e47f02df5cdb227b28e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1114/storytimeline_501114103.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        47,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/47/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:220470a87e06e3f186a4bd97",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然斗志昂扬并非坏事……\n担估计『秋华赏』前的狂热氛围会更胜以往。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a93eec4f14bfe0469b4267c37865c424400a89384d76c1cd991893720de4008f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1114/storytimeline_501114103.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        48,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/48/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b608593379eaf6542aedeac4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（必须设法让她放松下来……）",
      "source_fingerprint": "fdd75b2e027ffde34d49c5cec3c17157b394572862457fe82337b7a6bb75824d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1114/storytimeline_501114103.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        49,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/49/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aae874043345b9560497ccdf",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "如果迷人景致被那样的强烈情绪裹挟……\n很可能丧失心态平衡、\n无法发挥出真实水平。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2336b3d2f131b3bf71f5a3464bd07d4afc54c8a2f50218c5ebd1e5b26e09ec1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1114/storytimeline_501114103.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        49,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/49/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a7c114aedc556d25c21a498",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "从充满斗志的迷人景致身上、\n已不见『日本橡树大赛』后感觉到的那份隐忧。\n……莫非是当时的错觉吗。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c4959e6b93cf9b64f4fbad8ab0a2eb03f10ab7df89e29a3541603d852ca376e2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1114/storytimeline_501114103.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        5,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/5/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17e2370066e11222bb6ae56d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "仅靠惯用的深呼吸法恐怕不够。\n需要找到能让她彻底释放\n积压体内的亢奋的途径――",
      "source_fingerprint": "bfda3ece170296ddf09e60584f94fbf08ec5e2db8e05dce7c6799c16d424fb10",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1114/storytimeline_501114103.json",
      "json_path": [
